Z||000005||DecadenceR||07-02-2001||10:37 AM||||What do you suggest printing them onto? I know you said plastic sheeting, but is there a specific brand / type? And where would I get the material?||||reg||1
Z||000006||AusFiero||07-02-2001||10:47 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DecadenceR:<BR><B>What do you suggest printing them onto? I know you said plastic sheeting, but is there a specific brand / type? And where would I get the material?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I used plain old self adhesive laminating sheets, available at most office supply outlets. Although with the red ones (due to white backlit and lettering) do not need the paper layer described in the other thread. Printing the backlit layer on a translucent clear non adhesive laminating sheet would do it and stick the red adhesive one on top.<P>||||reg||1
