Z||000008||fierobaby||07-02-2001||11:25 AM||||ok why are the black one backwards?! and I hope you get that website soon I want to change my gages to something cool||||reg||1
Z||000009||AusFiero||07-02-2001||11:36 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierobaby:<BR><B>ok why are the black one backwards?! and I hope you get that website soon I want to change my gages to something cool</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You print them backwards so they can be stuck to the main faces with the ink side down. Helps protect the gauges basically. More info in the instructions thread.<P>||||reg||1
