Z||000037||MinnGreenGT||07-31-2001||01:04 PM||||For those who don't know what materials to use, go to your local Office Supply store (OfficeMax, OfficeDepot, Staples, etc...) and check in the aisle with printable labels. Avery makes a printable clear or Pritable White self-stick Label pages (for both Laser & Inkjet...be sure to get the right one). They are about $20 for 25 clear and $15 for 25 White Labels (8.5x11 InkJet). I hope this helps!<BR>-Rob<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngt.jpg"> ||||reg||1
